çNameDateDecember 23, 2025TitleUPDATE 17 ğŸ§ŠImagerbxassetid://76786660109423Codepatchnotes_2025festiveChangesscriptğŸ§Š SEASON 2Description)Welcome to Season 2 â€” The Polar Season!<Check out all of the brand new "Polar" themed content below!HeaderRANKED[Play Ranked, check out the new rewards, & climb to the top of the Ranked leaderboard again!ŒRanked now has stricter requirements to play â€” You must now be Level 50 & have completed 30 tasks in your career to gain access to Ranked!Brand new Ranked Contract rewards! Win ranked duels to earn a free universal charm, wrap, finisher, skin, and a bunch of Glory!ContentSummarySnowmanTuskyNorthern Light ShowFrozen Grenade	Thumbnailrbxassetid://118536505664958Season 2 is hereSEASON PASS$An entirely new Season Pass is here!jEarn FREE keys, charms, wraps, finishers, emotes, skins, and even a Prime weapon just by playing the game!rbxassetid://130454529533477The second ever Season Pass]Every time your Season Pass levels up, you get a free reward! Level it up by gaining Pass XP!•Pass XP can be earned simply by winning rounds in any kind of duel OR by simply playing the game! You can level up your Season Pass 7 times per week!rbxassetid://81169580441081)This is how you level up your Season Pass\Want access to even more rewards? Maybe a shiny new nametag? Check out the Prime Bundle now!Purchase the Contraband Bundle to get access to more Season Pass rewards, exclusive cosmetics, & a one-of-a-kind glitchy nametag!Prime Season PassPrime NametagContraband NametagGiant Snowball	Ice QueenCryo Capsule	It's Timerbxassetid://1297183238616773Look at all the cool stuff in the Contraband BundleµThe Season Pass can be found by pressing the "Pass" button at the bottom of your screen in the lobby. All rewards, offers, and relevant bundles can be found in the Season Pass page!This season's Season Pass is DISCOUNTED! Enjoy all of the luxuries of the Prime Bundle & Contraband Bundle at a much cheaper rate than before!OTHERuAll players that completed their placements last season have had their ranks reset & received special Ranked rewards!Ranked players have received Glory based on their final ELO & total wins! You should also have received the brand new Season 1 charm based on your final rank!{The Top 200 Archnemesis players have now also received their Mythical Arch Crossbow skin for the Crossbow! Congratulations!gSpend your new-found Glory at the Ranked Shop for cool & exclusive cosmetics for your favorite weapons!Arch CrossbowSeason 1GloryQThe previous Season Pass has concluded and is no longer available to progress in.†The weapons from the previous season â€” Distortion, Warper, & Warpstone â€” are now permanently on sale for keys in the Weapons page!
DistortionWarper	Warpstonerbxassetid://132174131924022#Season 1 weapons are now grindable!ğŸ„ FESTIVE EVENT1The Festive Event is back and better than before!\COLLECT CRYSTALS â€” Crystals can be earned from completing the new tasks on the Event page!@SPEND CRYSTALS â€” Spend your Crystals on new stuff in the Shop!eCRYSTALS RUSH â€” FREE x5 Crystal boost until you earn 250 Crystals! This boost comes back EVERY DAY!Festive Skin CaseJolly ChestFestive Wrap Box 2PenguinStocking FurSleigh AwaySleigh Riderbxassetid://103557120206373%Complete these tasks to earn Crystals(Brand new festive themed lobby and maps!rbxassetid://75362798125274Shoutout @GreatGuyBoom!(The second ever Advent Calendar is here!_Earn FREE rewards every single day throughout the holidays just by completing your Daily Tasks!'Log in on December 25th for a SURPRISE!	FireplaceSnowy NightElfifyrbxassetid://853534933380417Free rewards! Just complete your Daily Tasks every day!Here for a limited time only!âš”ï¸ WEAPONSNEW WEAPON - Permafrost!5This primary SMG weapon slows down any enemy you hit!gUse your ability to throw whatever's left in your magazine to instantly freeze enemies within a radius!CThe less ammo you have remaining, the shorter the freeze will last!ECheck out the Permafrost's brand new skins & weapon contract rewards!,Currently only available in the Season Pass!
