Cold Metalrbxassetid://84695073943979Slam your enemies responsibly0The Weapons page has been completely redesigned!fThe page should now be cleaner, more minimal, and better display what actually matters - your weapons!rbxassetid://136686334220847The brand new Weapons pageéWith this redesign comes new features â€” You can now favorite specific weapons, preview inverted locked wraps, favorite the default/none cosmetic to use with Random, & even preview your previous Ranked statistics in the Career page!vThe Emotes, Skin, Finisher, Wrap, & Charm button at the bottom of the Weapons now accurately displays what's equipped!pLast but not least, leveling up a weapon now costs less keys if the level bar is already filled up with some XP!rbxassetid://113745338007204The brand new Career pageğŸ—ºï¸ MAPSrbxassetid://110713820813038The brand new map â€” Iceberg!rbxassetid://78458667507109$The other brand new map â€” Village!ğŸ›’ COSMETICSfThe Crystal Bundles are back with a brand new, exclusive, Mythical Crystal Katana skin for the Katana!The Legendary Key Bundle now contains the brand new, exclusive, Mythical Keyrambit & Keylisong skins for the Knife â€” A buy 1 get 1 free deal!bThe Ultra Key Bundle now contains the brand new, exclusive, Mythical Keynais skin for the Daggers!MTwo new limited time wraps in the Shop's Home page â€” Ornamented & FrostbiteFNEW Darktru Charm - Eliminate @AtDarktru to earn this brand new charm!Crystal Katana	Keyrambit	KeylisongKeynais
Ornamented	FrostbiteDarktrurNew 2025 Festive Flash Sale Bundle! Available for a limited time only! Check out the Shop's Home page to see more!Crystal ScythePolarisCrystal Heartrbxassetid://137016485825506*The brand new Mythical Crystal Scythe skingSlightly new images for Flamethrower, Molotov, Jack O'Thrower, Torch, Vexed Candle, and Vexed Flare Gun;2025 Energy Rifle has been renamed to New Year Energy Rifle?2025 Energy Pistols has been renamed to New Year Energy Pistols/2025 Katana has been renamed to New Year Katana+Bone Crossbow has been renamed to Crossbone&Bonestone has been renamed to Warpbone/RPKEY & Keyzi now have new aiming sound effects5New animations for the Subspace Tripmine & it's skins,New animations for the Jump Pad & it's skinsNew animations for the RNG DiceğŸ® GAMEPLAY’HUGE performance increase across the entire game â€” especially in Arcade Servers! RIVALS should feel smoother, less jittery, and more performant!OThe Arcade Server has now been split up into mutliple different Arcade Servers!;Play your favorite gamemode on demand now in the Play page!rbxassetid://1261833998108197The Arcade Server has been split into different servers”The 1v1v1 and 2v2v2 gamemodes have been removed from the Play page and are now in the daily gamemodes cycle along with the brand new 3v3v3 gamemode!rbxassetid://107967446284645,The 3-team-duel gamemode is now limited time»There's a new streak recovery system! If you accidentally play a duel with a streak recovery option available, it will now disappear 24 hours later instead of instantly! No more slip-ups!rbxassetid://73581198934315=Developers & moderators can not help you recover your streaksJMap Contracts can now also be completed by winning rounds in Ranked duels!MYou can no longer see Map Contracts for maps that you haven't discovered yet!rbxassetid://129874034328562 Do you have a diorama charm yet?VTeam Deathmatch, Free For All, & Gun Game max health has been changed from 150 -> 100!KYou can no longer equip a Utility weapon in Team Deathmatch & Free For All!ğŸ¤ SOCIALBrand new Player List!YClick the Streak icon in the top right to sort the Player List by Streak, Level, or Rank!‰Click on a player in the new Player List to quickly 1v1 them, invite them to your party, spectate their duel, view their profile, & more!gThe Settings topbar UI has been moved to the top right of your screen, right above the new Player List!rbxassetid://124621830308678.Challenging your friends has never been easier@You can now write a note for any gift you send to other players!2You can now send anonymous gifts to other players!rbxassetid://119019021404827+Consider being generous this holiday seasonFYou can now transfer party leadership to another player in your party!rbxassetid://116375229411016'No more disbanding & recreating partiesğŸ”« BALANCE CHANGESBalancingOverviewBowGrenade LauncherRPGDaggersHandgun	SlingshotMolotovSniperUziJump Pad␀Left]ğŸ“ "Bow's arrows had a hard time landing & we wanted charged arrows to feel more impactful":ğŸ’ª Critical hit multiplier increased from 1.67x â†’ 2.0x<ğŸ’ª Projectile hitbox size increased from 2studs â†’ 3studs-ğŸ”» Charge time increased from 1.8s â†’ 2.3s]ğŸ“ "The Grenade Launcher has found a hard time being used for anything other than movement"$ğŸ’ª Damage increased from 40 â†’ 50.ğŸ’ª Max Ammo Reserve increased from 18 â†’ 24YğŸ“ "The RPG should punish players harder for not being able to dodge it's slow rockets"$ğŸ’ª Damage increased from 50 â†’ 60;ğŸ“ "The Sniper should feel weak in close-quarters-combat",ğŸ”» Move Speed decreased from -15% â†’ -20%-ğŸ“ "The projectiles were difficult to land"1ğŸ“ "Fine-tuning Handgun's last balance changes"&ğŸ’ª Max Ammo increased from 10 â†’ 12.ğŸ”» Max Ammo Reserve decreased from 90 â†’ 849ğŸ“ "The Uzi was overbuffed in the last balance changes",ğŸ”» Shoot spread increased from 3Â° â†’ 4Â°0ğŸ”» ADS Shoot spread increased from 0Â° â†’ 2Â°&ğŸ”» Max Ammo decreased from 30 â†’ 270ğŸ”» Max Ammo Reserve decreased from 120 â†’ 108xğŸ“ "The Slingshot should feel like a quick, reliable weapon. It's bouncing projectiles should also feel more reliable"2ğŸ’ª Equip cooldown decreased from 0.75s â†’ 0.45s"ğŸ’ª Damage increased from 7 â†’ 8+ğŸ’ª Move Speed increased from +5% â†’ +10%.ğŸ’ª Max Ammo Reserve increased from 75 â†’ 99>ğŸ’ª Projectile hitbox size increased from 2.5studs â†’ 3studsNğŸ“ "The Molotov's fire did not last long enough to control parts of the map"+ğŸ’ª Fire duration increased from 5s â†’ 7sğŸ“ "Just for fun"3â– You can now place jump pads ontop of each other
ğŸ›  OTHERImproved Codes UI%Slight changes to the Notification UI%Slight changes to the Duel History UISlight changes to the Party UI$New Daily Tasks UI in the Tasks page<Subtle improvements to the â€œSearching for playersâ€¦â€ UIFSpeed lines from speed boosts are much less visible if you stand still<Chat bubbles above heads have been disabled for Ranked duelsğŸ› BUG FIXESLFixed a bug that caused players to look like they aren't holding any weaponsGFixed a bug where simple emotes would temporarily mute the game's music[Fixed an audio bug with the Superhero, Witch Waltz, Flex, Warpmaker, & Portal Glitch emotes8Fixed the end game win screen for Big Onyx & Legacy OnyxqFixed a bug where the Blip finisher would cause health & ammo drops to not spawn where the player originally died\Fixed a visual bug where many weapons displayed a 0 Splash Radius metric in the weapons page}Fixed a bug with Revolver where shooting normally would become disabled if you picked up an ammo drop while using the abilityFixed a bug where Satchels attached to surfaces that disappear, such as Trowel walls, would fall through surfaces and not re-attach to anything1Fixed a visual bug with the Rainbow Barf finisher€Fixed an issue with Auto Shoot where quick attacking and switching back would cause your original weapon to attack for no reason‚Fixed a bug where players could still use their weapons when a duel ended in Arcade Servers by respawning at just the right momentHFixed an extremely rare bug that caused flashbang blinds to be permanentyFixed a bug that allowed players to complete their Freeze Ray contracts by freezing windows and other non-player entities:Fixed a bug that causes hotbar slots to visually duplicate_Potentially fixed a rare bug where inspecting cosmetics in the Weapons page doesn't do anything†Fixed a bug where throwables such as Grenade, Flashbang, etc. would have their cooldowns used up if you get frozen while throwing them>Fixed a bug where players were able to shoot through Jump PadsFFixed a bug where the game would randomly change who you're spectating>Fixed a visual bug with editing queue pads in a Private ServergFixed a rare bug that left you searching for a duel forever if a duel was found but the teleport failednFixed a bug where the Riot Shield no longer worked if you emoted and waited for it to naturally finish playing6Fixed a visual bug with the Laptop skin for the MedkitWFixed a bug where players could attack during an Arcade Server's intermission countdowniFixed a bug where players could "rubberband teleport" with a Riot Shield and Satchel in third person modexFixed a bug where using the War Horn right after you quick melee would trigger the cooldown but not give any speed boost/Fixed a speed glitch with upside down Jump PadsKFixed a few visual bugs on mobile devices when emoting with certain weaponsRFixed a bug where the Broom Ride finisher could move the cube in the Dimension map>Fixed a bug where in-game chat bubbles wouldn't auto-translateZFixed a visual bug with the Violin Crossbow skin where the neck was sticking out the body.]Fixed some collisions bugs in the Bridge map where some parts of the map blocked your bulletsRFixed some spots in the Crossroads map where you could glitch out using the warperEFixed spawns in the Big Graveyard, Station, Docks, and Big Arena maps,Fixed a lighting bug with the Graveyard maps.Fixed a bug that caused random server restarts^Fixed a bug where the Desert Eagle skin had a different reload speed than other Revolver skinsRFixed various warping bugs in Crossroads, Docks, Battlegrounds, Arena, & Big Arena®Fixed various bugs with the Snow Shovel skin, the Glorious Handgun skin, the Repulsor skin, the Hand Gun skin, the Plasma Distortion skin, the Warpeye skin, & the Camera skinRFixed a visual bug that made your Fists invisible when wrapped in the Weapons pagehFixed a bug that allowed you to eliminate players in the lobby with projectile weapons in Arcade Servers8Fixed a bug where streak tasks wouldn't recover properly…Fixed a bug that allowed players to not lose their streak from ragequitting if they reached their max duel pad wins for the day firstYFixed a bug that allowed players to quick melee through walls after dashing with Gunblade>Fixed a bug that allowed the Riot Shield to work while emoting–Fixed a bug where turning PVP in the Shooting Range on/off in a Private Server wouldn't take effect for players that are already in the Shooting Range+Fixed a visual bug for the scores UI in FFAKFixed a visual bug with the health bar when switching who you're spectatingMFixed a visual bug when using freecam in the Weapons page in a Private Serverâœ¨ EVERY NEW ITEMBorealisFestive LightsNew Year Sparklers
